    "investigation_finding": "CONFIRMED FACT: extras1_runs is strictly a categorical extra code, NOT a numeric run count! Mapping: 1 -> Overstep (no ball), 2 -> wide, 3 -> legbyes, 4 -> byes, 5 -> other (e.g. overthrows/free hits), 6 -> no extra (normal delivery, extras_type=NaN), 7 -> Penalty. CONFIRMED FACT: The 'runs' column contains runs off the bat (strikers score runs only when extras1_runs in {1, 5, 6}). For wide (code 2), legbyes (code 3), byes (code 4), penalty (code 7), 'runs' is 0 in 100% of cases. extras_2_runs is 0 for 200,963 deliveries (99.98%), and is non-zero (1 or 4) on exactly 36 deliveries, representing boundary extras or penalty adjustments on oversteps / other extra situations."
