    "boundary_analysis": "Whenever is_four==True, runs is ALWAYS 4 (0 exceptions). Whenever is_six==True, runs is ALWAYS 6 (0 exceptions). However, there are 21 deliveries where runs==4 but is_four==False (all run four by batters between wickets), and 3 deliveries where runs==6 but is_six==False (all run three plus 3 overthrows, or 2 runs plus 4 overthrows, meaning the ball did not cross the boundary rope directly on the fly).",
